{"id":"ae771d715f89349c","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-proof-sequence.md","title":"Coded Proof Sequence","display":"df-proof-sequence — Coded Proof Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-proof-sequence","aliases":["67-df-proof-sequence"],"display":"df-proof-sequence — Coded Proof Sequence","depends_on":["[[67-df-prim-theory]]","[[67-df-sequence]]","[[67-df-certified-proof]]","[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]"],"verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","source_proof_status":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-proof-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-proof-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-sequence — Coded Proof Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d91538d9e6829fd1\" href=\"?note=d91538d9e6829fd1\" title=\"67-df-prim-theory\">67-df-prim-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"338538aaf52f60c4\" href=\"?note=338538aaf52f60c4\" title=\"67-df-sequence\">67-df-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 带 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_T\">\\(E_T\\)</span> 是满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Present}_L(T,E_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Present}_L(T,E_T)\\)</span> 的固定有效呈示。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(p,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofSequence}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofSequence}_T\\)</span> 是下式定义的外部自然数关系，原始递归公理呈示与一般 r.e. 呈示均通过同一个有类型的证书接口处理。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofSequence}_T(p,n)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{CertifiedProof}_{L,E_T}(p,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ProofSequence}_T(p,n)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{CertifiedProof}_{L,E_T}(p,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_T\">\\(E_T\\)</span> 为 PR 公理特征呈示时，每行仍是公式代码；一般可枚举公理集则以行码携带枚举证书。最终结论限定为句子，逻辑中间行允许是开放公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-prim-theory","status":"resolved","id":"d91538d9e6829fd1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"338538aaf52f60c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-certified-proof","status":"resolved","id":"189f5355af0e487c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-certified-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 带 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 的编号 $g$；$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$E_T$ 是满足 [[67-df-certified-proof]] 中 $\\mathrm{Present}_L(T,E_T)$ 的固定有效呈示。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-certified-proof","status":"resolved","id":"189f5355af0e487c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 带 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 的编号 $g$；$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$E_T$ 是满足 [[67-df-certified-proof]] 中 $\\mathrm{Present}_L(T,E_T)$ 的固定有效呈示。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"E_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Present}_L(T,E_T)","display":false},{"tex":"p,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProofSequence}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProofSequence}_T(p,n)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{CertifiedProof}_{L,E_T}(p,n).","display":true},{"tex":"E_T","display":false}],"bytes":1346,"backlinks":[{"id":"be38aee184dd1b06","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProofSequence}_T(p,n)$ (coded proof-sequence predicate, see [[67-df-proof-sequence]])"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-proof-sequence]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-proof-sequence]]"}],"outgoing":["d91538d9e6829fd1","338538aaf52f60c4","189f5355af0e487c","a329235da6144513"]}